display_name = "Picket"
description = "Six tubes on a trunnion and a sensor dish, on legs. Built to be positioned, not driven: it sees further than anything that is not a drone and it reaches past anything that is not a cannon. The launcher only elevates, so everything it fires arcs. On legs, so it takes the kit a Rover cannot. Thin, and worth its seat only when there is ground you need hit from a long way off."
